{"unit_id":"PensiveFei__dsh-secure-audit#feature-1","repo":"PensiveFei/dsh-secure-audit","commit":"ae94c94183ef785702d34cc90e08705e8c32177b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-secure-audit 的功能「文本扫描」：对输入文本运行规则扫描并可选使用模型细化待复核结论。通过 security_scan_text 工具触发，返回 allow、review 或 block 判断及命中信息。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:206-210","lib/injection.js:305"]}
{"unit_id":"PensiveFei__dsh-secure-audit#feature-2","repo":"PensiveFei/dsh-secure-audit","commit":"ae94c94183ef785702d34cc90e08705e8c32177b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-secure-audit 的功能「文本脱敏」：遮盖文本中的手机号、证件号、银行卡号、邮箱、IP、API key 和 URL 凭据等支持类型。调用 security_redact_text，获得处理后的文本和分类统计。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:317-319","lib/redact.js:37","lib/rules.js:335-437"]}
{"unit_id":"PensiveFei__dsh-secure-audit#feature-3","repo":"PensiveFei/dsh-secure-audit","commit":"ae94c94183ef785702d34cc90e08705e8c32177b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-secure-audit 的功能「结构化 JSON 脱敏」：按敏感键名替换值，并对其他字符串值应用个人信息脱敏。调用 security_redact_json，保留 JSON 结构并返回替换路径和统计。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:377-379","lib/redact.js:179-208"]}
{"unit_id":"PensiveFei__dsh-secure-audit#feature-4","repo":"PensiveFei/dsh-secure-audit","commit":"ae94c94183ef785702d34cc90e08705e8c32177b","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-secure-audit 的功能「本地配置审计」：检查选定范围内的配置、会话、插件、路径、网络和环境信息。调用 security_audit 并选择 scope 与 quick 或 full profile，获得逐项报告。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:445-448","lib/audit.js:29","lib/audit.js:1022-1080"]}
