{"unit_id":"PensiveFei__dsh-secure-audit#caveat-1","repo":"PensiveFei/dsh-secure-audit","commit":"ae94c94183ef785702d34cc90e08705e8c32177b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-secure-audit 可将文本扫描内容发送到配置的 Ollama endpoint 进行本机模型分类；分类器为可选配置，默认端点是 localhost:11434。（见 lib/classifier.js:46-47）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/classifier.js:46-47"]}
{"unit_id":"PensiveFei__dsh-secure-audit#caveat-2","repo":"PensiveFei/dsh-secure-audit","commit":"ae94c94183ef785702d34cc90e08705e8c32177b","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-secure-audit 的实时依赖公告查询为 opt-in；开启后会向 registry.npmjs.org 查询，并发送已安装插件名称和版本。默认使用离线清单。（见 lib/audit.js:877-890）","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/audit.js:877-890"]}
